WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Two coils of wire share one iron core.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.510
They are not joined to each other.

3
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.350
The first coil has a cell and a switch.

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.060
The second has only a galvanometer.

5
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.490
Close the switch.

6
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.800
The needle flicks, then
drops back to zero.

7
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.840
Why does the needle move at all,
when no wire links the coils?

8
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.790
And why doesn't it stay there?

9
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.830
In this mission, you'll
push a magnet into a coil,

10
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.630
and find what makes the
needle flick further.

11
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.520
Then you'll watch a hanging metal ring
leap away from an approaching magnet.

12
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.440
Your mission: explain
why the needle flicks,

13
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.070
then returns to zero.
